# The wound's chance and its damage fold into one figure the way a Final
# Attack's do: a 40 + 2L% chance of 75 + 3L% every two seconds is what one tick
# is worth. Its 45-60 second stretch is dropped -- against a two-second tick it
# stands on anything still alive.
#
# The extra damage a wounded enemy takes lands on the character rather than on
# the enemies carrying the wound. That is Chance Attack's liberty in mirror
# image: that skill pays only against a pierced enemy and nothing here pierces,
# and this pays only against a wounded one and a Hero wounds everything.
#
# The wound ticks whether or not this is the swing the fight settled on, which
# reads as the Hero opening with it and then holding Raging Blow -- the way the
# job is played. So the swing below is the one a Hero rarely spends: what this
# skill is really worth to them is the wound and the damage it opens up.
name: "Puncture"
skill_order: 2
description:
  "Drive your sword down into the enemies in front of you, leaving a wound "
  "that bleeds. A wounded enemy takes more damage from everything."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
tags: SKILL_TAG_SWORDSMANSHIP
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_HERO
max_level: 30
exceeds_master_level: true
base_delay_ms: 720
max_enemies: 8
lines: 4
required_skill {
  skill_name: "Advanced Combo"
  level: 20
}
base {
  skill_pct: 3.13
  normal_skill_pct: 0.50
  damage_pct: 0.11
}
per_level {
  skill_pct: 0.03
  damage_pct: 0.00483
}
auto_mode {
  label: "Wound"
  cast_interval_seconds: 2.0
  max_enemies: 8
  lines: 1
  base { skill_pct: 0.3276 }
  per_level { skill_pct: 0.0456 }
}
